+{\Large\bfseries Parity-sharpened trapping\\at the critical endpoint}\\[10pt]
+{\large A sixth-order bound and a uniform radius improvement}\\[10pt]
+Unified Dynamics research workstream\quad |\quad 16 October 2026 UTC\\
+Version 0.1\quad |\quad Conditional theorem extension
