+\begin{abstract}
+The frozen critical orbit has an explicit energy-preserving isometric reflection. It reverses all three soft directions and fixes the leading fast-relaxation correction. Three parity cancellations remove the fifth-order loss responsible for the preceding very small sufficient radius. A sixth-order geodesic remainder and quantitative fast-variable completion preserve the same quartic orbit-distance coercivity on a larger explicit tube. An exact positive-coefficient comparison proves a radius improvement of at least 50,000 for every positive kinetic coefficient and matter norm, at each finite rank. No physical tolerance or maximal basin is inferred.
+\end{abstract}
+For $a,N>0$, finite $r\ge1$, and $\epsilon=\kappa/(rN)-k_*=0$, put
+\[
+\alpha=\min(a/2,N/100),\quad D=\frac{279N}{4\alpha},\quad J=\max(a,25N),
+\]
+\[
+C_3=279N,\qquad C_4=1600N,\qquad C_5=10000N.
+\]
+\begin{align*}
+S_6={}&\frac{9C_3^2D^2}{2\alpha}+\frac{C_3D^3}{6}
++\frac{C_4^2}{18\alpha}+5C_4D^2
++\frac{2C_5D}{15}+\frac{8C_5^2}{9\alpha}+264N,\\
+R_{\rm p}={}&\min\left\{\frac{\alpha}{500000N},\sqrt{\frac{N}{400S_6}}\right\}.
+\end{align*}
+\begin{theorem}[Larger explicit endpoint tube]\label{th:main}
+For the unchanged critical orbit $\mathcal O_*$ and the product metric of page 2,
+\[
+\boxed{H-H_*\ge\frac{N}{1600}d_g(x,\mathcal O_*)^4
+\quad\text{for }d_g(x,\mathcal O_*)\le R_{\rm p}.}
+\]
+For every $0<\eta\le R_{\rm p}$, the boundary barrier and sufficient initial radius are
+\[
+B_\eta=\frac{N\eta^4}{1600},\qquad
+\delta_\eta=\eta^2\sqrt{\frac{N}{1600J}}.
+\]
+Initial distance at most $\delta_\eta$ implies all-time distance less than $\eta$. Initial distance less than $\eta$ and energy excess below $B_\eta$ also suffice. Zero Gauss is included by invariance. Compared with the radius $R_{\rm EQT}$ in [1],
+\[
+\boxed{R_{\rm p}\ge50000R_{\rm EQT}\quad\text{for every }a,N>0.}
+\]
+\end{theorem}
+\textbf{Status.} Development, no registry entry. Derived conditional mathematics; frozen action and coefficient ledger unchanged. Constructor checks only; independent review pending; physical promotion $0$.
